      </row>
      <row id="`.ts`" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.ts`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.ts`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Adding a source" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Adding a source</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eine Quelle hinzufügen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Choose _Project › Add source…_ (toolbar: ➕ Source) and select one or more files." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Choose _Project › Add source…_ (toolbar: ➕ Source) and select one or more files.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wählen Sie _Projekt › Quelle hinzufügen…_ (Werkzeugleiste: ➕ Quelle) und wählen Sie eine oder mehrere Dateien aus.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Enter the _Original language_ of the files, for example `en`." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Enter the _Original language_ of the files, for example `en`.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Geben Sie die _Originalsprache_ der Dateien ein, zum Beispiel `en`.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Click _Add_." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Click _Add_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Klicken Sie auf _Hinzufügen_.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Susi stores the files relative to the project and reads them immediately." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Susi stores the files relative to the project and reads them immediately.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Susi speichert die Dateien relativ zum Projekt und liest sie sofort ein.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Scanning" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Scanning</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Scannen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Project › Scan for changes_ (`F5`, toolbar: ⟳ Scan) reads all sources again, for example after the developers changed the program:" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Project › Scan for changes_ (`F5`, toolbar: ⟳ Scan) reads all sources again, for example after the developers changed the program:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Projekt › Scannen_ (`F5`, Werkzeugleiste: ⟳ Scannen) liest alle Quellen neu ein, zum Beispiel nachdem die Entwickler das Programm geändert haben:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="New texts are added with the row status _New_." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>New texts are added with the row status _New_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Neue Texte kommen mit dem Zeilenstatus _Neu_ hinzu.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Changed texts get the row status _Changed_, and their translations _For review_." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Changed texts get the row status _Changed_, and their translations _For review_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Geänderte Texte bekommen den Zeilenstatus _Geändert_ und ihre Übersetzungen _Zur Prüfung_.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Texts that are no longer in the file get the row status _Unused_. Their translations are kept, in case the text comes back." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Texts that are no longer in the file get the row status _Unused_. Their translations are kept, in case the text comes back.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Texte, die nicht mehr in der Datei stehen, bekommen den Zeilenstatus _Nicht verwendet_. Ihre Übersetzungen bleiben erhalten, falls der Text zurückkommt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The tab _Output_ shows a summary. _Project › Remove unused rows_ deletes the unused rows when they are no longer needed." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The tab _Output_ shows a summary. _Project › Remove unused rows_ deletes the unused rows when they are no longer needed.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Reiter _Ausgabe_ zeigt eine Zusammenfassung. _Projekt › Unbenutzte Zeilen entfernen_ löscht die nicht verwendeten Zeilen, wenn sie nicht mehr gebraucht werden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Building" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Building</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Erstellen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Project › Build_ (`F9`, toolbar: 🔨 Build) writes one translated file per source and language, for example `Resources.de.resx`, `de/messages.po` or `res/values-b+de/strings.xml`. The tab _Output_ lists every file written. Texts that are not translated get the original text or are left out, depending on the kind of file, so the program shows the original instead." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Project › Build_ (`F9`, toolbar: 🔨 Build) writes one translated file per source and language, for example `Resources.de.resx`, `de/messages.po` or `res/values-b+de/strings.xml`. The tab _Output_ lists every file written. Texts that are not translated get the original text or are left out, depending on the kind of file, so the program shows the original instead.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Projekt › Erstellen_ (`F9`, Werkzeugleiste: 🔨 Erstellen) schreibt je Quelle und Sprache eine übersetzte Datei, zum Beispiel `Resources.de.resx`, `de/messages.po` oder `res/values-b+de/strings.xml`. Der Reiter _Ausgabe_ listet jede geschriebene Datei auf. Texte, die nicht übersetzt sind, bekommen je nach Dateiart den Originaltext oder werden weggelassen, sodass das Programm stattdessen das Original zeigt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="To scan or build a single source, use the context menu of the source in the project tree." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>To scan or build a single source, use the context menu of the source in the project tree.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Um eine einzelne Quelle zu scannen oder zu erstellen, verwenden Sie das Kontextmenü der Quelle im Projektbaum.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Source properties" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Source properties</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eigenschaften der Quelle</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Right-click the source in the project tree and choose _Properties…_:" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Right-click the source in the project tree and choose _Properties…_:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Klicken Sie mit der rechten Maustaste auf die Quelle im Projektbaum und wählen Sie _Eigenschaften…_:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Setting" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md src/pseudo-translation.md src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Setting</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Einstellung</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Original language_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Original language_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Originalsprache_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The language of the texts in the file." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The language of the texts in the file.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Sprache der Texte in der Datei.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Localized files contain_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Localized files contain_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Lokalisierte Dateien enthalten_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Different_: only texts whose translation differs from the original. _Translated_: only translated texts. _All_: all texts." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Different_: only texts whose translation differs from the original. _Translated_: only translated texts. _All_: all texts.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Unterschiedliche_: nur Texte, deren Übersetzung vom Original abweicht. _Übersetzte_: nur übersetzte Texte. _Alle_: alle Texte.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Output directory_ and _File pattern_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Output directory_ and _File pattern_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Ausgabeverzeichnis_ und _Dateimuster_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Where the translated files are written and how they are named. Placeholders such as `&lt;iso&gt;` (language code), `&lt;file&gt;` (file name) or `&lt;body&gt;` (name without extension) are replaced." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Where the translated files are written and how they are named. Placeholders such as `&lt;iso&gt;` (language code), `&lt;file&gt;` (file name) or `&lt;body&gt;` (name without extension) are replaced.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wohin die übersetzten Dateien geschrieben werden und wie sie heißen. Platzhalter wie `&lt;iso&gt;` (Sprachcode), `&lt;file&gt;` (Dateiname) oder `&lt;body&gt;` (Name ohne Erweiterung) werden ersetzt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Encoding_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Encoding_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Kodierung_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="For Java `.properties` files: the character encoding of the translated files." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>For Java `.properties` files: the character encoding of the translated files.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bei Java-`.properties`\-Dateien: die Zeichenkodierung der übersetzten Dateien.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_PO options_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_PO options_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_PO-Optionen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="For gettext files: read comments, create `.mo` files and more." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>For gettext files: read comments, create `.mo` files and more.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bei gettext-Dateien: Kommentare einlesen, `.mo`\-Dateien erzeugen und mehr.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Excluded data types_" created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Excluded data types_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Ausgeschlossene Datentypen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="For `.resx` files: pictures, binary data or text files that are not to be translated." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>For `.resx` files: pictures, binary data or text files that are not to be translated.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bei `.resx`\-Dateien: Bilder, Binärdaten oder Textdateien, die nicht übersetzt werden sollen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Usually the developers set these up once. Ask them before you change the output settings: the program expects the translated files in a certain place." created="20261123194613" note="src/sources.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Usually the developers set these up once. Ask them before you change the output settings: the program expects the translated files in a certain place.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Meist richten die Entwickler das einmal ein. Fragen Sie sie, bevor Sie die Ausgabeeinstellungen ändern: Das Programm erwartet die übersetzten Dateien an einer bestimmten Stelle.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="A pseudo translation is an artificial translation for testing. It shows early, before the real translation, whether the program is ready for other languages: whether all texts come from the resource files, whether longer texts fit into the dialogs and whether special characters are displayed correctly." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>A pseudo translation is an artificial translation for testing. It shows early, before the real translation, whether the program is ready for other languages: whether all texts come from the resource files, whether longer texts fit into the dialogs and whether special characters are displayed correctly.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eine Pseudoübersetzung ist eine künstliche Übersetzung zum Testen. Sie zeigt früh, noch vor der echten Übersetzung, ob das Programm für andere Sprachen bereit ist: ob alle Texte aus den Ressourcendateien kommen, ob längere Texte in die Dialoge passen und ob Sonderzeichen richtig angezeigt werden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Creating a pseudo translation" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Creating a pseudo translation</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eine Pseudoübersetzung erstellen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Translation › Create pseudo translation…_ opens a dialog:" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Translation › Create pseudo translation…_ opens a dialog:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Übersetzung › Pseudoübersetzung erstellen…_ öffnet einen Dialog:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Language_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Language_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Sprache_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The language that receives the pseudo translation. It is created as a pseudo language if necessary, for example `qps`." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The language that receives the pseudo translation. It is created as a pseudo language if necessary, for example `qps`.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Sprache, die die Pseudoübersetzung bekommt. Sie wird bei Bedarf als Pseudo-Sprache angelegt, zum Beispiel `qps`.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Kind_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Kind_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Art_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Emulation_ changes the original as set below. _Replace_ replaces every character by a fill character, _Reduce_ shortens every text to its first character. _Longest translation_ takes the longest text of the row in any language and changes it like _Emulation_." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Emulation_ changes the original as set below. _Replace_ replaces every character by a fill character, _Reduce_ shortens every text to its first character. _Longest translation_ takes the longest text of the row in any language and changes it like _Emulation_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Emulation_ verändert das Original wie unten eingestellt. _Ersetzen_ ersetzt jedes Zeichen durch ein Füllzeichen, _Reduzieren_ kürzt jeden Text auf sein erstes Zeichen. _Längste Übersetzung_ nimmt den längsten Text der Zeile in irgendeiner Sprache und verändert ihn wie _Emulation_.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Diacritics_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Diacritics_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Diakritische Zeichen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Replaces letters by similar ones with accents: `Save` becomes `Šàvé`." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Replaces letters by similar ones with accents: `Save` becomes `Šàvé`.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ersetzt Buchstaben durch ähnliche mit Akzenten: Aus `Save` wird `Šàvé`.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Expand text_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Expand text_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Text verlängern_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Makes the texts longer, as many languages need more space than English." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Makes the texts longer, as many languages need more space than English.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Macht die Texte länger, denn viele Sprachen brauchen mehr Platz als Englisch.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Enclose in delimiters_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Enclose in delimiters_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Mit Begrenzungszeichen einschließen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Puts delimiters around every text, so cut-off texts are easy to spot." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Puts delimiters around every text, so cut-off texts are easy to spot.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Setzt Begrenzungszeichen um jeden Text, damit abgeschnittene Texte leicht auffallen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Case_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Case_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Groß-/Kleinschreibung_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Leaves the case unchanged, alternates it or uses upper case." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Leaves the case unchanged, alternates it or uses upper case.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Lässt die Schreibung unverändert, wechselt sie ab oder verwendet Großbuchstaben.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Overwrite existing translations_" created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Overwrite existing translations_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Vorhandene Übersetzungen überschreiben_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Also replaces real translations of the language. Existing pseudo translations are always renewed." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Also replaces real translations of the language. Existing pseudo translations are always renewed.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ersetzt auch echte Übersetzungen der Sprache. Vorhandene Pseudoübersetzungen werden immer erneuert.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Sample_ shows the effect on an example text. Click _Create_, then build the project and start the program with the pseudo language." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Sample_ shows the effect on an example text. Click _Create_, then build the project and start the program with the pseudo language.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Beispiel_ zeigt die Wirkung an einem Beispieltext. Klicken Sie auf _Erstellen_, erstellen Sie dann das Projekt und starten Sie das Programm mit der Pseudo-Sprache.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Translation › Remove pseudo translations_ deletes the pseudo translations again." created="20261123194613" note="src/pseudo-translation.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Translation › Remove pseudo translations_ deletes the pseudo translations again.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Übersetzung › Pseudoübersetzungen entfernen_ löscht die Pseudoübersetzungen wieder.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Not everybody who translates has Susi. You can export the texts into a file, send it to a translator or an agency, and import the translated file again." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Not everybody who translates has Susi. You can export the texts into a file, send it to a translator or an agency, and import the translated file again.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Nicht jeder, der übersetzt, hat Susi. Sie können die Texte in eine Datei exportieren, sie an einen Übersetzer oder eine Agentur schicken und die übersetzte Datei wieder importieren.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Formats" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Formats</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Formate</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Format" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Format</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Format</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Extension" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Extension</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Endung</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Good for" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Good for</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Gut für</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Excel workbook" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Excel workbook</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Excel-Arbeitsmappe</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="`.xlsx`" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.xlsx`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.xlsx`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translators who work in Excel; screenshots can be embedded." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translators who work in Excel; screenshots can be embedded.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Übersetzer, die in Excel arbeiten; Screenshots lassen sich einbetten.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="CSV" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>CSV</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">CSV</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="`.csv`" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.csv`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.csv`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Other spreadsheet programs (separated by semicolons)." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Other spreadsheet programs (separated by semicolons).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Andere Tabellenprogramme (durch Semikolons getrennt).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="`.txt`" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.txt`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.txt`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Simple tools (separated by tabs)." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Simple tools (separated by tabs).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Einfache Werkzeuge (durch Tabulatoren getrennt).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="XLIFF 1.2" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>XLIFF 1.2</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">XLIFF 1.2</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="`.xlf`" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.xlf`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.xlf`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translation tools of agencies (one file per language)." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translation tools of agencies (one file per language).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Übersetzungswerkzeuge von Agenturen (eine Datei pro Sprache).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="TMX" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>TMX</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">TMX</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="`.tmx`" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>`.tmx`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">`.tmx`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translation memories of other tools." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translation memories of other tools.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Translation Memorys anderer Werkzeuge.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Exporting" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Exporting</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Exportieren</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Set a filter if you want to export only some rows, for example only _Not translated_." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Set a filter if you want to export only some rows, for example only _Not translated_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Setzen Sie einen Filter, wenn Sie nur einige Zeilen exportieren wollen, zum Beispiel nur _Nicht übersetzt_.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Choose _File › Export (Excel, CSV, XLIFF, TMX)…_ and enter a file name. The extension decides the format." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Choose _File › Export (Excel, CSV, XLIFF, TMX)…_ and enter a file name. The extension decides the format.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wählen Sie _Datei › Exportieren (Excel, CSV, XLIFF, TMX)…_ und geben Sie einen Dateinamen ein. Die Endung bestimmt das Format.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Choose the options and click _Export_:" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Choose the options and click _Export_:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wählen Sie die Optionen und klicken Sie auf _Exportieren_:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Languages_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Languages_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Sprachen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The languages to export." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The languages to export.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Sprachen, die exportiert werden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Only the rows the sheet shows now, otherwise all rows." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Only the rows the sheet shows now, otherwise all rows.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Nur die Zeilen, die die Tabelle gerade zeigt, sonst alle Zeilen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Status columns_, _Comment columns_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Status columns_, _Comment columns_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Statusspalten_, _Kommentarspalten_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="A status and a comment column for every language." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>A status and a comment column for every language.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eine Status- und eine Kommentarspalte für jede Sprache.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Row status column_, _&quot;Max. characters&quot; column_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Row status column_, _"Max. characters" column_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Zeilenstatus-Spalte_, _Spalte „Max. Zeichen“_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="More information on the rows." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>More information on the rows.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Weitere Angaben zu den Zeilen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Include &quot;Do not translate&quot; rows_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Include "Do not translate" rows_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_„Nicht übersetzen“-Zeilen einschließen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Also exports the rows that must not be translated." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Also exports the rows that must not be translated.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Exportiert auch die Zeilen, die nicht übersetzt werden dürfen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Language of column headers and status values_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Language of column headers and status values_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Sprache der Spaltenüberschriften und Statuswerte_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The language of the column titles, for example English for an agency abroad." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The language of the column titles, for example English for an agency abroad.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Sprache der Spaltentitel, zum Beispiel Englisch für eine Agentur im Ausland.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Screenshots_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Screenshots_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Screenshots_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Whether screenshots are embedded (Excel, on a second worksheet), copied as files next to the export with links, or left out." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Whether screenshots are embedded (Excel, on a second worksheet), copied as files next to the export with links, or left out.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ob Screenshots eingebettet werden (Excel, auf einem zweiten Tabellenblatt), als Dateien mit Links neben den Export kopiert oder weggelassen werden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Tell the translators to keep the columns _Source_, _Context_ and _Original_ unchanged: Susi needs them to find the rows again." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Tell the translators to keep the columns _Source_, _Context_ and _Original_ unchanged: Susi needs them to find the rows again.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bitten Sie die Übersetzer, die Spalten _Quelle_, _Kontext_ und _Original_ nicht zu verändern: Susi braucht sie, um die Zeilen wiederzufinden.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Importing" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Importing</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Importieren</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Choose _File › Import…_ and select the translated file. Then decide:" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Choose _File › Import…_ and select the translated file. Then decide:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wählen Sie _Datei › Importieren…_ und wählen Sie die übersetzte Datei aus. Entscheiden Sie dann:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Replaces translations that are already in the project. Without it, only empty cells are filled." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Replaces translations that are already in the project. Without it, only empty cells are filled.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ersetzt Übersetzungen, die schon im Projekt sind. Ohne diese Option werden nur leere Zellen gefüllt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Skip rows whose original has changed_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Skip rows whose original has changed_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Zeilen mit geändertem Original überspringen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Ignores rows whose original has changed since the export, because the translation may no longer fit." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Ignores rows whose original has changed since the export, because the translation may no longer fit.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Lässt Zeilen aus, deren Original sich seit dem Export geändert hat, weil die Übersetzung vielleicht nicht mehr passt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Import comments_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Import comments_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Kommentare importieren_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Takes over the comments of the file." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Takes over the comments of the file.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Übernimmt die Kommentare der Datei.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Status for imported texts without a status_" created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Status for imported texts without a status_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Status für importierte Texte ohne Statusangabe_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The status for translations that come without a status column." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The status for translations that come without a status column.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Status für Übersetzungen, die ohne Statusspalte kommen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The tab _Output_ shows how many translations were imported, kept or skipped. Column headers and status values are recognized in every language of the user interface." created="20261123194613" note="src/exchange.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The tab _Output_ shows how many translations were imported, kept or skipped. Column headers and status values are recognized in every language of the user interface.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Reiter _Ausgabe_ zeigt, wie viele Übersetzungen importiert, behalten oder übersprungen wurden. Spaltenüberschriften und Statuswerte werden in jeder Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche erkannt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Many programs are developed with git, on a server such as GitLab or GitHub. Susi can exchange your translations with this server for you, without any git knowledge. A developer prepares this once; afterwards Susi shows the menu _Workflow_ and three buttons in the toolbar." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Many programs are developed with git, on a server such as GitLab or GitHub. Susi can exchange your translations with this server for you, without any git knowledge. A developer prepares this once; afterwards Susi shows the menu _Workflow_ and three buttons in the toolbar.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Viele Programme werden mit Git entwickelt, auf einem Server wie GitLab oder GitHub. Susi kann Ihre Übersetzungen für Sie mit diesem Server austauschen, ganz ohne Git-Kenntnisse. Ein Entwickler bereitet das einmal vor; danach zeigt Susi das Menü _Workflow_ und drei Schaltflächen in der Werkzeugleiste.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The three steps" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The three steps</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die drei Schritte</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Step" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Step</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Schritt</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="What happens" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>What happens</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Was passiert</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="1" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>1</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">1</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="📥 _Get translation project…_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>📥 _Get translation project…_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">📥 _Übersetzungsprojekt holen…_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Fetches the latest version of the project from the server and opens it." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Fetches the latest version of the project from the server and opens it.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Holt die neueste Version des Projekts vom Server und öffnet sie.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="2" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>2</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">2</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="📤 _Save changes…_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>📤 _Save changes…_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">📤 _Änderungen zwischenspeichern…_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Builds the translated files, saves the project and sends your changes to the server, into a branch of your own." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Builds the translated files, saves the project and sends your changes to the server, into a branch of your own.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Erstellt die übersetzten Dateien, speichert das Projekt und überträgt Ihre Änderungen auf den Server, in einen eigenen Zweig.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="3" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>3</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">3</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="🚀 _Prepare publication…_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>🚀 _Prepare publication…_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">🚀 _Veröffentlichung vorbereiten…_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Asks a reviewer to check your changes and take them over (a merge request on GitLab, a pull request on GitHub)." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Asks a reviewer to check your changes and take them over (a merge request on GitLab, a pull request on GitHub).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bittet einen Prüfer, Ihre Änderungen zu kontrollieren und zu übernehmen (ein Merge Request bei GitLab, ein Pull Request bei GitHub).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="You can save your changes as often as you like, also after preparing the publication: the reviewer then sees the latest state." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>You can save your changes as often as you like, also after preparing the publication: the reviewer then sees the latest state.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Sie können Ihre Änderungen so oft zwischenspeichern, wie Sie wollen, auch nach der Vorbereitung der Veröffentlichung: Der Prüfer sieht dann den neuesten Stand.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Getting the translation project" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Getting the translation project</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Das Übersetzungsprojekt holen</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Workflow › Get translation project…_ replaces your local copy with the latest version from the server. If you have changes that are not saved on the server yet, Susi warns you: they are set aside and can only be restored by a developer. Save them first if you want to keep them." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Workflow › Get translation project…_ replaces your local copy with the latest version from the server. If you have changes that are not saved on the server yet, Susi warns you: they are set aside and can only be restored by a developer. Save them first if you want to keep them.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Workflow › Übersetzungsprojekt holen…_ ersetzt Ihre lokale Kopie durch die neueste Version vom Server. Haben Sie Änderungen, die noch nicht auf dem Server gespeichert sind, warnt Susi Sie: Sie werden beiseitegelegt und lassen sich nur von einem Entwickler wiederherstellen. Speichern Sie sie vorher zwischen, wenn Sie sie behalten wollen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Saving changes" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Saving changes</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Änderungen zwischenspeichern</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Workflow › Save changes…_ shows the branch and the changed files. Choose the _Kind of change_:" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Workflow › Save changes…_ shows the branch and the changed files. Choose the _Kind of change_:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Workflow › Änderungen zwischenspeichern…_ zeigt den Zweig und die geänderten Dateien. Wählen Sie die _Art der Änderung_:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_New translations (feat)_ for new texts," created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_New translations (feat)_ for new texts,</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Neue Übersetzungen (feat)_ für neue Texte,</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Corrected translations (fix)_ for corrections," created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Corrected translations (fix)_ for corrections,</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Korrigierte Übersetzungen (fix)_ für Korrekturen,</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Maintenance (chore)_ for anything else." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Maintenance (chore)_ for anything else.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Wartung (chore)_ für alles andere.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The first time you save, Susi creates a personal branch for your changes. Only the project and its translated files are sent, never other files." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The first time you save, Susi creates a personal branch for your changes. Only the project and its translated files are sent, never other files.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Beim ersten Zwischenspeichern legt Susi einen persönlichen Zweig für Ihre Änderungen an. Übertragen werden nur das Projekt und seine übersetzten Dateien, nie andere Dateien.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Preparing the publication" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Preparing the publication</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Veröffentlichung vorbereiten</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Workflow › Prepare publication…_ creates the merge or pull request. Enter a title and a description and choose the reviewers. When the request is created, _Workflow › Open merge request in the browser_ (or _pull request_) shows it on the server." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Workflow › Prepare publication…_ creates the merge or pull request. Enter a title and a description and choose the reviewers. When the request is created, _Workflow › Open merge request in the browser_ (or _pull request_) shows it on the server.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Workflow › Veröffentlichung vorbereiten…_ erstellt den Merge oder Pull Request. Geben Sie einen Titel und eine Beschreibung ein und wählen Sie die Prüfer. Ist der Request erstellt, zeigt ihn _Workflow › Merge Request im Browser öffnen_ (bzw. _Pull Request_) auf dem Server.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The state in the status bar" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The state in the status bar</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Zustand in der Statusleiste</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="State" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>State</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Zustand</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Meaning and next step" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Meaning and next step</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Bedeutung und nächster Schritt</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Up to date_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Up to date_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Aktuell_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Translate, then save your changes." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Translate, then save your changes.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Übersetzen Sie und speichern Sie dann Ihre Änderungen zwischen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Update available_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Update available_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Aktualisierung verfügbar_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="A newer version is on the server: get the translation project." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>A newer version is on the server: get the translation project.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Auf dem Server gibt es eine neuere Version: Holen Sie das Übersetzungsprojekt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Changes not saved on the server_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Changes not saved on the server_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Änderungen nicht auf dem Server gespeichert_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Save your changes." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Save your changes.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Speichern Sie Ihre Änderungen zwischen.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Saved, not published_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Saved, not published_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Zwischengespeichert, nicht veröffentlicht_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="When you are done, prepare the publication." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>When you are done, prepare the publication.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wenn Sie fertig sind, bereiten Sie die Veröffentlichung vor.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_In review_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_In review_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_In Prüfung_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The reviewer checks your changes. You can still save further changes." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The reviewer checks your changes. You can still save further changes.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Prüfer kontrolliert Ihre Änderungen. Sie können weiterhin Änderungen zwischenspeichern.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Published_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Published_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Veröffentlicht_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Your changes were accepted. Get the translation project to continue with the latest version." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Your changes were accepted. Get the translation project to continue with the latest version.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ihre Änderungen wurden übernommen. Holen Sie das Übersetzungsprojekt, um mit der neuesten Version weiterzuarbeiten.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Fixed version_" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Fixed version_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Feste Version_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="An older version is shown for reading. Get the translation project to continue working." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>An older version is shown for reading. Get the translation project to continue working.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Eine ältere Version wird zum Lesen angezeigt. Holen Sie das Übersetzungsprojekt, um weiterzuarbeiten.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Click the state to ask the server for the latest information (_Workflow › Refresh state_ does the same)." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Click the state to ask the server for the latest information (_Workflow › Refresh state_ does the same).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ein Klick auf den Zustand fragt den Server nach dem neuesten Stand (_Workflow › Zustand aktualisieren_ tut dasselbe).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Signing in" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Signing in</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Anmelden</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The server needs to know who you are. _Workflow › Sign in to the server…_ stores an access token, a kind of password for programs, which you create on the server:" created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The server needs to know who you are. _Workflow › Sign in to the server…_ stores an access token, a kind of password for programs, which you create on the server:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Der Server muss wissen, wer Sie sind. _Workflow › Am Server anmelden…_ speichert ein Zugriffstoken, eine Art Passwort für Programme, das Sie auf dem Server erstellen:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="**GitLab**: a personal access token with the scope `api`." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>**GitLab**: a personal access token with the scope `api`.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">**GitLab**: ein persönliches Zugriffstoken mit dem Bereich `api`.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="**GitHub**: a fine-grained personal access token for the repository with the permissions _Contents_ and _Pull requests_ (read and write)." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>**GitHub**: a fine-grained personal access token for the repository with the permissions _Contents_ and _Pull requests_ (read and write).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">**GitHub**: ein fein abgestuftes persönliches Zugriffstoken (fine-grained) für das Repository mit den Berechtigungen _Contents_ und _Pull requests_ (Lesen und Schreiben).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Your developers tell you which server to use and can help you create the token. Susi keeps it in the credential store of the operating system, never in the project." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Your developers tell you which server to use and can help you create the token. Susi keeps it in the credential store of the operating system, never in the project.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Ihre Entwickler sagen Ihnen, welchen Server Sie verwenden, und helfen beim Erstellen des Tokens. Susi bewahrt es im Anmeldespeicher des Betriebssystems auf, nie im Projekt.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Advanced settings_ in the dialogs allow other branches or versions. You normally do not need them." created="20261123194613" note="src/git-workflow.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Advanced settings_ in the dialogs allow other branches or versions. You normally do not need them.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Erweiterte Einstellungen_ in den Dialogen erlauben andere Zweige oder Versionen. Normalerweise brauchen Sie sie nicht.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Tools › Options…_ contains the personal settings. They apply to all projects." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Tools › Options…_ contains the personal settings. They apply to all projects.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Extras › Einstellungen…_ enthält die persönlichen Einstellungen. Sie gelten für alle Projekte.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Translation memory (TMX)_" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Translation memory (TMX)_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Translation Memory (TMX)_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The file of the [translation memory](translation-memory.md). Empty: the default file in the settings folder of Susi." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The file of the [translation memory](translation-memory.md). Empty: the default file in the settings folder of Susi.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Datei des [Translation Memory](translation-memory.md). Leer: die Standarddatei im Einstellungsordner von Susi.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Minimum fuzzy match_" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Minimum fuzzy match_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Mindestwert unscharfe Treffer_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="How similar a text must be, in percent, to be offered as a suggestion from the translation memory." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>How similar a text must be, in percent, to be offered as a suggestion from the translation memory.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wie ähnlich ein Text in Prozent sein muss, damit er als Vorschlag aus dem Translation Memory angeboten wird.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_User interface language_" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_User interface language_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Automatic (system language)_, _English_ or _Deutsch_. Takes effect immediately." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Automatic (system language)_, _English_ or _Deutsch_. Takes effect immediately.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Automatisch (Systemsprache)_, _English_ oder _Deutsch_. Wirkt sofort.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Automatically save translated texts&lt;br&gt;to the translation memory when saving_" created="20261126123725" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Automatically save translated texts&lt;br&gt;to the translation memory when saving_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261126123813" status="3">_Übersetzte Texte beim Speichern automatisch&lt;br&gt;ins Translation Memory übernehmen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Adds your translations to the translation memory every time you save the project." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Adds your translations to the translation memory every time you save the project.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Übernimmt Ihre Übersetzungen bei jedem Speichern des Projekts in das Translation Memory.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Show &quot;Context&quot; column_,&lt;br&gt;_Show &quot;Row comment&quot; column_,&lt;br&gt;_Show &quot;Translated on&quot; column_" created="20261126114539" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Show "Context" column_,&lt;br&gt;_Show "Row comment" column_,&lt;br&gt;_Show "Translated on" column_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261126123907" status="3">_Spalte „Kontext“ anzeigen_,&lt;br&gt;_Spalte „Zeilenkommentar“ anzeigen_,&lt;br&gt; _Spalte „Übersetzt am“ anzeigen_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The optional columns of the [translation sheet](sheet.md)." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The optional columns of the [translation sheet](sheet.md).</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die zuschaltbaren Spalten der [Übersetzungstabelle](sheet.md).</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="_Dark theme_" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>_Dark theme_</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">_Dunkles Design_</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Dark colors instead of light ones." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Dark colors instead of light ones.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Dunkle statt heller Farben.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="The columns and the dark theme can also be switched in the menu _View_, the user interface language in _Tools › User interface language_." created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>The columns and the dark theme can also be switched in the menu _View_, the user interface language in _Tools › User interface language_.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Die Spalten und das dunkle Design lassen sich auch im Menü _Ansicht_ umschalten, die Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche unter _Extras › Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche_.</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Where Susi keeps its settings" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Where Susi keeps its settings</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Wo Susi seine Einstellungen ablegt</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Susi keeps the settings, the default translation memory and the size and position of its window in a settings folder of your user account:" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Susi keeps the settings, the default translation memory and the size and position of its window in a settings folder of your user account:</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Susi legt die Einstellungen, das Standard-Translation-Memory und Größe und Position seines Fensters in einem Einstellungsordner Ihres Benutzerkontos ab:</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Windows: `%APPDATA%\susi`" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Windows: `%APPDATA%\susi`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Windows: `%APPDATA%\susi`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="Linux and macOS: `~/.config/susi`" created="20261123194613" note="src/options.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>Linux and macOS: `~/.config/susi`</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Linux und macOS: `~/.config/susi`</lang>
      </row>
      <row id="On macOS, use `Cmd` instead of `Ctrl`." created="20261123194613" note="src/shortcuts.md" notereadonly="1">
        <native>On macOS, use `Cmd` instead of `Ctrl`.</native>
        <lang id="de" date="20261123194651" status="3">Unter macOS verwenden Sie `Cmd` statt `Strg`.</lang>
      </row>
